{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the frontline of &quot;Ants with Guns,&quot;  Experience the scientifically accurate battle simulator that brings ants to the forefront of the battlefield, armed with newfound firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So now you can make ants battle for queen and candy in this new breed of sandbox battle simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Ants packing heat:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take command of an army of ants armed to the mandibles with an array of tiny yet powerful firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Flying Units Dogfights:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Engage in intense dogfights with flying units, or man the anti-aircraft guns and bring down the airborne onslaught. The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Direct Ant Control:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the action by directly controlling your ant soldiers in first or third person. It's an ant's-eye view of the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Kaiju Bugs:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > tackle kaiju-sized monster bug bosses in epic showdowns.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ants were harmed in the creation of this game.\u2217</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2217Maybe... we honestly weren't really paying that close of attention.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1968390?t=1769614727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1968390?t=1769614727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769614727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams